        "original_id": "067aabdc-384c-551e-86a5-d99aaf86a914",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Big Data\n- Songs: \"Dangerous\"\n- Albums/EPs: \"1.0\", \"2.0\"\n- Artists: Joywave\n- Organizations/Charts: Billboard, RIAA\n\nFacts:\n- Big Data is an American electronic music project.\n- \"Dangerous\" is a song by Big Data.\n- \"Dangerous\" appeared on Big Data's debut EP \"1.0\" in 2013.\n- In August 2014, Big Data's single \"Dangerous\", featuring Joywave, reached number one on the Billboard Alternative Songs chart.\n- In May 2015, the RIAA certified \"Dangerous\" gold.\n- \"Dangerous\" appeared on Big Data's debut studio album \"2.0\" in 2015.",
